{#
  The event's main description.

  Markdown, rendered to trusted HTML at BUILD time by markdown-it with raw HTML
  disabled — so an editor can never inject markup, and the same renderer that
  handled the old `prose` blocks handles this. It emits real <p>, a bare
  <blockquote> for a highlighted statement (which is what `.prose blockquote`
  styles), and <img> for a photograph placed between paragraphs.
#}
{%- if body %}
    <div class="prose reveal">
      {{ body | eventBody | safe }}
    </div>
{%- endif %}
